      "text": "[10:42AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nWe are still having rapid vehicular movement from Berger enroute Tollgate and Iyana Oworo.\n\nConnecting the Third mainland bridge towards the island is also good.\n\nComing from Obalende bridge to connect Third mainland bridge via Ilubirin down to Iyana Oworo is very free.\n\nProceeding towards Tollgate is also good to go.\n\nThere is a broken down well-parked articulated truck at Secretariat inward Otedola with no effect on traffic flow.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@lagostraffic961\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@trafficpalava",
